---
title: "Open Questions — What We Don’t Know — Situational AI"
description: "Situational AI is a research hypothesis, not a finished theory. The open questions, by theme: definition, recognition, representation, perspective, memory, dynamics, situation space, architecture, evaluation, and human correction."
ogTitle: "What We Don’t Know — Situational AI"
nav: "research"
navbarScrolled: true
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
---
  <header class="blog-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Open questions</span>
        <h1>What We Don’t Know</h1>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Situational AI is a research hypothesis, not a finished theory. Some of these questions have projects attached. Some are deliberately left unanswered. All of them are the work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="research-shell">
        <nav class="question-index" aria-label="Themes">
          {%- for q in questions %}<a href="#{{ q.slug }}">{{ q.theme }}</a>{% endfor %}
        </nav>
        {%- for q in questions %}
        <section class="question-theme" id="{{ q.slug }}">
          <span class="section-tag">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }} · {{ q.theme }}</span>
          <h2>{{ q.intro }}</h2>
          <ol class="question-list">
            {%- for text in q.questions %}<li>{{ text }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ol>
          {%- set related = projects | bySlugs(q.projects) %}
          {%- if related.length %}
          <p class="event-list-meta">Being worked on in: {% for pr in related %}<a href="{{ pr.url }}">{{ pr.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
          {%- else %}
          <p class="event-list-meta">No project on this yet.</p>
          {%- endif %}
        </section>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark is-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <span class="section-tag">Working on something related?</span>
        <h2>Talk with us.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <a href="/participate.html#inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
        <a href="/research/projects.html" class="btn btn-ghost">See the Projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
